# Sapling Nursery, the whole card. Affinity for Forests (CR 702.41a): on turn 5 Bot1 controls two Forests (Bot2's two Forests
# and Bot1's own Island do not count), so {6}{G}{G} costs {4}{G}{G}: six mana, paid by the two Forests, the Island and three Mox
# Emeralds, and nothing floats afterwards (a cost of five would leave a mana in the pool). On turn 7 a Forest entering
# triggers landfall: a 3/4 green Treefolk with reach. On Bot2's turn 8 Damnation is cast and, in response, Bot1 pays {1}{G} and
# exiles the Nursery: Treefolk and Forests Bot1 controls gain indestructible until end of turn (the Treefolk survives, the Forests
# are indestructible), but the Island does not and Bot2's Forests do not. Bot1's Ornithopter, neither, is destroyed.

